@base = http://localhost:5121
@workflow = 50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@quote = replace-with-the-id-returned-by-planning-quotes

### Register authoritative candidate metadata before planning
POST {{base}}/api/v1/catalog/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "name": "C# architect",
  "kind": "Human",
  "hourlyRate": 50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "skills": {"csharp": 5}
}

### Calculate a durable quote from persisted metadata and actual bookings
POST {{base}}/api/v1/planning/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "from": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "to": "2026-10-20T10:00:00Z",
  "currency": "USD",
  "candidateIds": ["30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"],
  "slots": [{"id": "60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "name": "Lead", "kind": "Human", "requiredSkills": {"csharp": 5}}],
  "validitySeconds": 300
}

### Development: create a license pool
POST {{base}}/api/v1/licenses/compiler/pool?totalSeats=5

### Immutable proposal; repeat with the same ID/data to recover its current state
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowId": "{{workflow}}",
  "quoteId": "{{quote}}",
  "licenses": [{"product": "compiler", "seats": 2}],
  "completionTimeoutSeconds": 300
}

### A proposal does not reserve anything until approved; ETag initially equals "1"
GET {{base}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflow}}

### Approve the exact reviewed version; use the ETag returned by GET
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflow}}/approve
If-Match: "1"

### Poll until Succeeded, Compensated, Failed or NeedsAttention
GET {{base}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflow}}

### Cancellation releases workflow-owned effects; replace "4" with the latest ETag
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflow}}/cancel
If-Match: "4"

### Operator queue: unresolved outcomes awaiting investigation
GET {{base}}/api/v1/workflows?state=NeedsAttention&limit=20

### Resume only NeedsAttention after fixing the cause; supply its current ETag
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workflows/{{workflow}}/resume
If-Match: "5"
